{"3741600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeon Trail", "steam_appid": 3741600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Trail is an abstracted dungeon crawler where you send adventurers on a quest, making use of dice manipulation to overcome challenges. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You love gambling, don't you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/6a3cfbed02608d341cbe15bf40b0202e.poster.avif?t=1772467704\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/6a3cfbed02608d341cbe15bf40b0202e.webm?t=1772467704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/6a3cfbed02608d341cbe15bf40b0202e.mp4?t=1772467704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The archfiend known as the Lord of Greed awoke from his slumber to spread chaos throughout the world. As the Guildmaster, you are tasked with hiring adventurers and guiding them on a quest to stop him. But how are newbie mercenaries from a small town guild meant to defy such odds? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Money. The answer is &quot;money&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/5f5cb0d43a21d6bb6f5dc14dcb519841.poster.avif?t=1772467704\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/5f5cb0d43a21d6bb6f5dc14dcb519841.webm?t=1772467704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/5f5cb0d43a21d6bb6f5dc14dcb519841.mp4?t=1772467704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of Dungeon Trail, Fate is an entity that loves gold and will accept bribes in exchange for second chances. Whether an attack would fail to hit, a trap would hurt too much or an enemy blow would result in certain death, a little gold coin can be offered to change one's immediate destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sword, sorcery and rolling bones<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/1d7d95848da2e631d945b8656d187838.poster.avif?t=1772467704\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/1d7d95848da2e631d945b8656d187838.webm?t=1772467704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/1d7d95848da2e631d945b8656d187838.mp4?t=1772467704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where's the fun of gambling without a little cheating? Dice manipulation isn't only allowed, it's encouraged with Tricks, which are consumables that allow you to determine specific results easily. We can't let leave everything up to Fate...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reroll, regroup, restart.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure where managing resources (be them gold, health or human lives) is everything and the difference between perishing or profiting is decided by dice throws. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your party can be substituted easily should any of them perish. If the difficulty feels overwhelming, a Prestige mechanic allows you to go back with more resources and start over stronger. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A new challenge every run:</i> Events are randomized every time you play for maximum dungeon crawling goodness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Change destiny</i>: use gold to reroll your way out of dangerous situations or into good fortune, or Tricks to change specific dice to predetermined results!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>15 Character Classes</i>, leading to over 1365 possible final party configurations! Will you prioritize battles, safety or gold farming?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>80+ enemies</i> to battle, with abilities that will require attention and a lot of luck to get through!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Easy to pick up, hard to put down:</i> Gameplay designed to be played in short bursts, with autosave on every Town and a Prestige feature to give players a smoother restart if they fall on hard times late in a run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No microtransactions</i>: dive deep into the fun part of gambling without any real world consequences.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Trail is an abstracted dungeon crawler where you send adventurers on a quest, making use of dice manipulation to overcome challenges. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You love gambling, don't you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/6a3cfbed02608d341cbe15bf40b0202e.poster.avif?t=1772467704\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/6a3cfbed02608d341cbe15bf40b0202e.webm?t=1772467704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/6a3cfbed02608d341cbe15bf40b0202e.mp4?t=1772467704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The archfiend known as the Lord of Greed awoke from his slumber to spread chaos throughout the world. As the Guildmaster, you are tasked with hiring adventurers and guiding them on a quest to stop him. But how are newbie mercenaries from a small town guild meant to defy such odds? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Money. The answer is &quot;money&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/5f5cb0d43a21d6bb6f5dc14dcb519841.poster.avif?t=1772467704\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/5f5cb0d43a21d6bb6f5dc14dcb519841.webm?t=1772467704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/5f5cb0d43a21d6bb6f5dc14dcb519841.mp4?t=1772467704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of Dungeon Trail, Fate is an entity that loves gold and will accept bribes in exchange for second chances. Whether an attack would fail to hit, a trap would hurt too much or an enemy blow would result in certain death, a little gold coin can be offered to change one's immediate destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sword, sorcery and rolling bones<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/1d7d95848da2e631d945b8656d187838.poster.avif?t=1772467704\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/1d7d95848da2e631d945b8656d187838.webm?t=1772467704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/1d7d95848da2e631d945b8656d187838.mp4?t=1772467704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where's the fun of gambling without a little cheating? Dice manipulation isn't only allowed, it's encouraged with Tricks, which are consumables that allow you to determine specific results easily. We can't let leave everything up to Fate...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reroll, regroup, restart.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure where managing resources (be them gold, health or human lives) is everything and the difference between perishing or profiting is decided by dice throws. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your party can be substituted easily should any of them perish. If the difficulty feels overwhelming, a Prestige mechanic allows you to go back with more resources and start over stronger. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A new challenge every run:</i> Events are randomized every time you play for maximum dungeon crawling goodness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Change destiny</i>: use gold to reroll your way out of dangerous situations or into good fortune, or Tricks to change specific dice to predetermined results!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>15 Character Classes</i>, leading to over 1365 possible final party configurations! Will you prioritize battles, safety or gold farming?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>80+ enemies</i> to battle, with abilities that will require attention and a lot of luck to get through!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Easy to pick up, hard to put down:</i> Gameplay designed to be played in short bursts, with autosave on every Town and a Prestige feature to give players a smoother restart if they fall on hard times late in a run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No microtransactions</i>: dive deep into the fun part of gambling without any real world consequences.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A role playing game where you gamble with human lives. Roll dice, change fate.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/f09cb849b2f61fb5e1dc34633d8d83e936f4efa6/header.jpg?t=1772467704", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/579bab37f0decf1ce2ed103b58ccd2591de38ddd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772467704", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/579bab37f0decf1ce2ed103b58ccd2591de38ddd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772467704", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["My Brother And I Make Games"], "publishers": ["My Brother And I Make Games"], "demos": [{"appid": 4003190, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 799, "final": 799, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$7.99"}, "packages": [1317013], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Dungeon Trail", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1317013, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Dungeon Trail - $7.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 799}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full c